# SPRINT-1: normalize line endings so Windows and other checkouts avoid whole-file diffs
* text=auto eol=lf

# SPRINT-19: Apple Pay domain association. Apple verifies it byte-for-byte; no platform or git
# setting may ever rewrite its line endings. `binary` = -text -diff. Must stay AFTER the rule above.
apps/web/public/.well-known/apple-developer-merchantid-domain-association binary

*.{cmd,bat} text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pdf binary
